WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.500
Almost everything is paid by card or transfer: wages, rent and benefits go into a bank account.

2
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:22.800
To open one you will be asked for an identity document (your passport or eVisa) and often proof of address (a council letter, a bill or your tenancy agreement).

3
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:38.800
If a bank says no, ask about a «basic bank account»: a simple account with no overdraft, designed for people with no history in the country. App-only digital banks usually ask for less paperwork.

4
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:47.100
To send money home, compare the fee and the exchange rate before you send it.

5
00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:53.100
Say it aloud: “I'd like to open a bank account.”.
